    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You may want to sleep inside the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "belly",
            "ref": "v-belly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of a snake in this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "amazing",
            "ref": "v-amazing"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Airbnb* house!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Snake House is in a park in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Mexico",
            "zh": "墨西哥"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It looks like a large snake on the grass. There are ten "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "apartments",
            "ref": "v-apartment"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in its body. One of them is open for rent. It has five bedrooms. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Up to",
            "zh": "多达"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " ten people can sleep in it. There is also a kitchen, a dining room, bathrooms and large round windows with window seats."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There are no doors in the Snake House "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "apart from",
            "zh": "除了"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "entrance",
            "ref": "v-entrance"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". All the rooms are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "connected",
            "ref": "v-connect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tunnels",
            "zh": "隧道"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". People get around through the tunnels and climb a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "staircase",
            "ref": "v-staircase"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to go into the snake’s mouth. There are some great "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "views",
            "zh": "景色"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the park from there."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A visitor said, “Sleeping inside the belly of a snake was so amazing. I also enjoyed taking a walk in the park. I felt like Alice in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wonderland",
            "zh": "仙境"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "* Airbnb爱彼迎，全球知名民宿预订平台，房东可以在此出租闲置房源，旅行者也能租住特色民居。它为出行者提供了区别于传统酒店的住宿选择。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
